{"id":"vod_sn_38388","vodId":"38388","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"世纪末救世主传说 北斗神拳","name_cn":"世纪末救世主传说 北斗神拳","date":"1984-01-01","year":"1984","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4450972d0dc1e6d1311ede9246a8a16d.jpg"},"summary":"公元199X年，人类世界的最高首领因一己私欲发动战争，甚至愚蠢地按下毁灭世界的按钮。世界遭受核武器洗礼，山崩地裂，海水枯竭。部分人类虽侥幸存活，然地球上资源短缺，使得血腥纷争仍在继续。　　世间传说“有北斗出现的地方，必现乱事”。身上有七处伤疤、北斗密宗神拳继承者健四郎孤独行走在干涸的大地上，寻找心爱的女人尤丽娅。一路上艰难险阻不断，各路强手如云，健四郎在宿命的引领下一次次穿越充斥血雨腥风的生死屠场……　　根据武论尊、原哲夫的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:00:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":152,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CPDQkVrJk61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sXshm4YC061/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MivaiB5jNu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9LvuDP2i0W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3ddWRZ8fPr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wqPNq5T0NT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Gw3jTj2qZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FJepW88XbY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yT07TmcbeT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4yKGwjTn4K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ALybxQgTfS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GiaHFnB13J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/108cJVU8501/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QrbD7fMpCq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Pug8imNS